at UNO.

00:15:07.197 --> 00:15:11.702
I just-- I think everyone involved
would feel more comfortable.

00:15:11.785 --> 00:15:12.745
-Definitely.
-I just...

00:15:13.203 --> 00:15:14.121
Um...

00:15:14.455 --> 00:15:15.497
Yeah. Uh...

00:15:17.625 --> 00:15:18.751
So I...

00:15:19.251 --> 00:15:21.545
might call you a Lyft right now?

00:15:21.629 --> 00:15:22.463
-Yeah.
-Great.

00:15:22.921 --> 00:15:24.590
Um...

00:15:24.673 --> 00:15:26.925
[mumbling] Um...

00:15:31.388 --> 00:15:33.515
I do the usual stuff.

00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:36.268
-I like to read, I like to watch TV.
-[laughing]

00:15:36.352 --> 00:15:37.853
I like to play video games.

00:15:37.937 --> 00:15:39.563
-I'm a video game professor.
-Me too.

00:15:39.647 --> 00:15:40.481
-Really?
-Yes.

00:15:40.564 --> 00:15:42.775
-What's your favorite game?
-FIFA.

00:15:42.858 --> 00:15:43.859
Amazing!

00:15:43.943 --> 00:15:44.944
Is that yours?

00:15:45.027 --> 00:15:48.697
I'm not so into sports games, but I--

00:15:48.781 --> 00:15:51.367
