-[laughing]

00:15:51.492 --> 00:15:54.161
-I love Dance Dance Revolution.
-So you think you can dance?

00:15:54.244 --> 00:15:55.412
[laughs]

00:15:55.496 --> 00:15:58.123
-Do you think you can tap dance?
-Well...

00:15:58.207 --> 00:16:01.001
Well, my mom might have something
to say about that.

00:16:01.085 --> 00:16:02.503
Let's... Shall we?

00:16:02.586 --> 00:16:03.420
Oh!

00:16:04.213 --> 00:16:05.881
Is that a challenge? A tap-off?

00:16:05.964 --> 00:16:08.592
[stammers] Are you challenging me to a--

00:16:08.676 --> 00:16:10.427
Oh, God. You've already won.

00:16:10.761 --> 00:16:12.346
[laughing]

00:16:12.429 --> 00:16:13.263
Can you wing?

00:16:13.555 --> 00:16:15.224
-Uh, is that...
-Yes!

00:16:15.307 --> 00:16:16.934
Flap, flap, flap.

00:16:17.017 --> 00:16:18.769
-So impressed.
-[laughs]

00:16:18.852 --> 00:16:20.729
Your mom would be proud actually.

00:16:21.271 --> 00:16:22.106
That was...

00:16:22.606 --> 00:16:24.400
-that was beautiful.
-Impressed.

00:16:25.067 --> 00:16:26.694
-You really can dance.
-[laughs]

00:16:28.028 --> 00:16:31.115
Well, thank you so much for tonight.
It's been great.

00:16:31.198 --> 00:16:32.908
I had such a great time meeting you.

00:16:32.992 --> 00:16:35.494
It's been so wonderful
meeting you, Stephanie.

00:16:35.577 --> 00:16:38.205
-I hope we get to see each other again.
-I hope so too.

00:16:38.706 --> 00:16:39.748
Yeah.

00:16:39.832 --> 00:16:41.333
Let me get the door for you.

00:16:41.959 --> 00:16:42.835
Uh...

00:16:42.918 --> 00:16:45.045
-Thank you.
-Thank you so much.

00:16:47.464 --> 00:16:49.133
-Take care, Stephanie.
-Thank you.

00:16:49.216 --> 00:16:50.259
