00:16:50.342 --> 00:16:51.176
Good night.

00:17:00.227 --> 00:17:03.564
This is actually
the place I was thinking of.

00:17:03.647 --> 00:17:04.565
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:17:04.648 --> 00:17:06.191
-Want to try it out?
-If it looks okay...

00:17:06.275 --> 00:17:07.234
Yeah, we should...

00:17:07.735 --> 00:17:08.777
We should probably--

00:17:08.861 --> 00:17:11.363
