00:17:11.447 --> 00:17:13.240
We'd better-- We don't want to be...

00:17:14.241 --> 00:17:15.784
-Ugly.
-Mm-mm.

00:17:18.704 --> 00:17:20.998
-All right, let's do it. Let's go in.
-Okay, let's go. Let's do it.

00:17:21.081 --> 00:17:24.126
-[chuckling]
-Time once more into the breach.

00:17:28.338 --> 00:17:29.173
Here?

00:17:31.216 --> 00:17:32.051
Thank you.

00:17:33.427 --> 00:17:35.137
-It's beautiful in here.
-Yeah.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:37.056
-It's really nice.
-I like it.

00:17:38.098 --> 00:17:39.683
I had an amazing time.

00:17:41.018 --> 00:17:42.352
It's just been an experience.

00:17:42.436 --> 00:17:45.189
Going on a blind date for the first time
