00:17:45.272 --> 00:17:47.191
but, like, thank you for...

00:17:47.858 --> 00:17:49.318
thank you for making it so--

00:17:49.568 --> 00:17:52.446
Shall we shake each other's hands?
I don't know.

00:17:52.529 --> 00:17:53.363
Shake hands.

00:17:54.615 --> 00:17:56.450
So...

00:17:56.533 --> 00:18:01.622
Are you comfortable talking about, like,
what you're looking for in a relationship?

00:18:01.705 --> 00:18:03.040
Sure. I mean...

00:18:03.749 --> 00:18:04.583
I don't know.

00:18:04.666 --> 00:18:06.877
I mean, I'm looking for a connection.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.337
-Yeah.
-Primarily.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:12.132
And someone who I can relate to
on a lot of different levels.

00:18:12.216 --> 00:18:14.718
-Intellectually, artistically.
-Mm-hmm.

00:18:14.802 --> 00:18:16.220
That's what I'm looking for.

00:18:16.303 --> 00:18:17.638
That-- And that's--

00:18:18.263 --> 00:18:19.890
-I mean, me too. [laughs]
-Yes.

00:18:19.973 --> 00:18:21.308
Yeah. [chuckles]

00:18:21.558 --> 00:18:24.394
-Huzzah. [laughs]
-Huzzah... [laughs]

00:18:25.395 --> 00:18:27.397
[laughs] Um...

00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:28.440
I'm...

00:18:28.982 --> 00:18:35.405
I guess, like, I'm nervous that, like,
I've only been in this long relationship.

00:18:35.489 --> 00:18:36.615
What was, like...

00:18:38.867 --> 00:18:40.035
the final straw?

00:18:42.079 --> 00:18:44.081
-[exhales]
-Was there a final straw?

00:18:44.164 --> 00:18:45.165
Yeah.

00:18:45.249 --> 00:18:47.209
We had gone through, like, a long...

00:18:47.793 --> 00:18:49.920
low point. And then she...

00:18:50.504 --> 00:18:53.465
pitched being in an open relationship.

00:18:54.049 --> 00:18:55.050
Interesting.

00:18:55.134 --> 00:18:58.387
Which was not necessarily

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.639
-something that I felt comfortable with.
-Same.

00:19:00.722 --> 00:19:04.143
But she was really excited about it.

00:19:04.226 --> 00:19:06.770
So I was like, "Okay."

00:19:06.854 --> 00:19:08.021
Um...

00:19:08.272 --> 00:19:12.109
And she then started dating someone
almost immediately.

00:19:12.442 --> 00:19:13.652
-Oh.
-Uh...

00:19:14.361 --> 00:19:15.320
Um...

00:19:16.363 --> 00:19:17.823
I did not feel rage.

00:19:18.323 --> 00:19:19.575
I did not feel jealousy.

00:19:20.075 --> 00:19:21.660
-Indifference?
-She would go over--

00:19:22.494 --> 00:19:23.328
Not even that.

00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:24.663
Happiness.

00:19:25.455 --> 00:19:26.373
And, like, that...

00:19:26.957 --> 00:19:31.628
kind of is what set the wheels in motion
of, like, "Maybe...

00:19:32.212 --> 00:19:34.089
I'm not actually...

00:19:34.464 --> 00:19:37.092
