as I kind of thought I was."

00:19:37.718 --> 00:19:38.886
Fully get it.

00:19:38.969 --> 00:19:41.930
In fact, I feel like
you're super selfless... [inhales]

00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:46.435
for even considering just letting her,
essentially, do her thing

00:19:46.518 --> 00:19:49.354
