and you didn't.

00:19:49.438 --> 00:19:52.649
And I feel like that says a lot about you
and your character,

00:19:52.733 --> 00:19:54.902
that you were open to that to begin with.

00:19:55.569 --> 00:19:56.904
Thank-- Thank you.

00:19:59.823 --> 00:20:02.242
I'm having a really amazing evening
with you.

00:20:02.326 --> 00:20:05.162
