that is just infectious.

00:20:12.669 --> 00:20:14.630
It energizes me.

00:20:14.713 --> 00:20:18.634
From the moment I first saw you,
like, that was on my mind

00:20:18.717 --> 00:20:23.597
and I've just been wanting all evening
to, like, say how wonderful you are.

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.641
-I really appreciate that.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:20:26.934 --> 00:20:30.187
I know you probably need to get home
to your kids.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:32.648
I've got to teach class in the morning.

00:20:32.731 --> 00:20:35.734
