00:20:42.991 --> 00:20:43.867
I'm glad.

00:20:49.456 --> 00:20:50.582
[chuckles]

00:20:54.169 --> 00:20:56.254
-Yeah? No? Yeah?
-Mm-hmm.

00:20:56.338 --> 00:20:57.339
Mm-hmm, do you...

00:20:58.382 --> 00:20:59.258
Uh...

00:20:59.341 --> 00:21:00.175
You seem like a...

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.761
