-On the cheek?
-Yeah.

00:21:36.628 --> 00:21:38.505
-Okay.
-Lovely.

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:39.673
[laughs]

00:21:41.049 --> 00:21:43.010
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

00:21:43.635 --> 00:21:46.430
-I think that's very appropriate.
-I agree.

00:21:46.513 --> 00:21:48.682
Great. [chuckling]

00:21:50.309 --> 00:21:53.228
-Can I kiss you on your cheek again?
-Okay, sure. [chuckles]

00:21:53.312 --> 00:21:54.438
-[table thuds]
-[gasps]

00:21:54.521 --> 00:21:55.981
