[laughs, inhales sharply]

00:22:05.699 --> 00:22:08.285
-That was fun.
-Um... it was really fun.

00:22:08.368 --> 00:22:10.787
Can I--? Can I walk you out?

00:22:10.871 --> 00:22:12.205
Sure. [smacks lips]

00:22:12.289 --> 00:22:13.373
-All right.
-Let's go.

00:22:13.457 --> 00:22:14.291
Great.

00:22:14.416 --> 00:22:16.418
[chuckles] Mmm...

00:22:16.585 --> 00:22:19.504
[laughs]

00:22:19.838 --> 00:22:21.048
