00:22:29.306 --> 00:22:33.268
I just want to say, Alex, how...

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:37.314
-beautiful you are and how kind you are.
-Thank you.

00:22:37.981 --> 00:22:42.778
There aren't a lot of people like you,
I feel, in the world, Alex.

00:22:42.861 --> 00:22:45.030
Thank you so much. That's really sweet.

00:22:45.113 --> 00:22:48.825
-I had such an amazing time with you.
-Me too.

00:22:52.245 --> 00:22:53.413
Uh...

00:22:53.538 --> 00:22:56.833
-Hey, hey! Hey, Jaden.
-Hey.

00:22:56.958 --> 00:22:59.086
-Um... uh, Jaden...
-Mm-hmm.

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:00.962
I like you.

00:23:01.838 --> 00:23:03.965
I like you too. [chuckles]

00:23:04.049 --> 00:23:08.220
-I would really like to see you again.
-Okay.

00:23:09.179 --> 00:23:11.473
